  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "feng mid micelre unweor\u00f0nesse, & hiene het iernan on his agenum purpurum fela \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee his mod w\u00e6s mid \u00fe\u00e6m bismre ahwet, he for eft on Perse, & hie gefliemde, & \u00dea onfeng Dioclitianus Galerius weor\u00f0lice. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Dioclitianus & Maximianus bebudon ehtnesse cristenra monna, Dioclitianus & for \u00feon gebode gewurdon fela martyra on X wintra firste. \u00dea gewear\u00f0 hi him betweonum \u00fe\u00e6t hie woldon \u00fea onwaldas forl\u00e6tan, & \u00fea purpuran alecgan \u00fea & \u00fe\u00e6t swa gel\u00e6ston. Dioclitianus ges\u00e6t on Nicomidio \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, & Maximianus ges\u00e6t on Mediolane \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. & leton \u00fea onwealdas to Galeriuse & to Constantiuse. & hi hiene tod\u00e6ldon si\u00fe\u00fean on tu: Galerius nom Ilirice, & begeondan \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feone eastende, & Ac he w\u00e6s hwon giernende \u00feissa worold\u00feinga & micelra onwalda, & for \u00fe\u00e6m he forlet his \u00dea gesette Galerius II cyningas under him: o\u00feer w\u00e6s haten Seuerus, \u00fe\u00e6m he gesealde Italiam & On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Constantius, se mildesta monn, for on Brettannie, & \u00fe\u00e6r gefor. & gesealde his suna \u00fe\u00e6t rice Constantinuse, \u00feone he h\u00e6fde be Elenan his ciefese. \u00dea wolde Maxentius, Maximianuses sunu, habban \u00feone anwald on Italiam. \u00dea sende Galerius him ongean Seuerus mid fierde, \u00fee him se onweald \u00e6r geseald w\u00e6s, & he \u00fe\u00e6r \u00dea Maximianus geacsade \u00fe\u00e6t",
